<title>USA: Bay Area Bancshares to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Bay Area Bancshares to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Area Bancshares said Tuesday it plans to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it believes its stock is undervalued and that the repurchases are an attractive use of the holding company's accumulated resources.</p>
<p>Total repurchases over time are not expected to exceed five percent of the outstanding shares and the cost of the plan is capped at $500,000.</p>
</text>
